Don't use it. Risk is silent or loud failure at runtime on older Node versions.

Implement it instead—takes one function:

```javascript
function findLast(array, predicate) {
  for (let i = array.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
    if (predicate(array[i], i, array)) return array[i];
  }
  return undefined;
}
```

Or inline the loop where you need it. Same behavior, no dependency on Node version.
